msgctxt "64"
msgid "...Who's the girl?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "My daughter. Name's Saki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "You have a daughter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Not by blood. I took her in, oh... maybe three years ago now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Now about those eviction notices."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "I'm listening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"I'm real sorry to be doing this to you, but I don't have\r\n"
"a ton of choice in the matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "And why's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Well, the family's owned the land you're sittin' on for\r\n"
"decades now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"We built the houses over there ourselves and have been\r\n"
"subletting 'em since, but now a potential buyer's come\r\n"
"knocking, and we're not planning on turning 'em down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Someone wants the land?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Yup. Sounds like it's gonna be the site of some fancy\r\n"
"schmancy new resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Hm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "What, you hadn't heard?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "This is my first time, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Well, the word is they're gonna plop a big resort on the\r\n"
"land your little neighborhood's on now. Either that, or use\r\n"
"it for a brand new American military base."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "It's been all over the news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "So that's why you're trying to evict us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Yup. I've gotta admit my feelings are kinda mixed on the\r\n"
"whole shebang, bein' Okinawa born and raised and all...\r\n"
"but who am I to stand in the way of progress?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"So, what do you say? Think of it as a favor. Me and the\r\n"
"rest of the Ryudo Family'll really owe you one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Look, Rikiya told me about the orphanage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"...Trust me, I know from Saki how hard raising kids that\r\n"
"age can be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"But you mainlanders are practically made of money, right?\r\n"
"Can't you just take your kids somewhere else?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"And if you really need some extra cash, we might be able\r\n"
"to spot you a little somethin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Well? Not a bad deal, huh?"
msgstr ""

